<i>the 1994 World Cup</i>
<i>Wrestling Championship,</i>

210
00:08:34.248 --> 00:08:35.182
<i>the winner of</i>

211
00:08:35.282 --> 00:08:37.818
<i>the Men's Freestyle National</i>
<i>Championship,</i>

212
00:08:37.918 --> 00:08:40.921
<i>an NCAA Division 1 champion,</i>

213
00:08:41.022 --> 00:08:42.690
<i>he stands 6'1",</i>

214
00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:46.327
<i>-and weighs in at 255 pounds.</i>
-(CROWD CHEERING)

215
00:08:46.427 --> 00:08:48.863
ANNOUNCER 1: <i>He's fighting out</i>
<i>of Phoenix, Arizona,</i>

216
00:08:48.963 --> 00:08:52.166
<i>please welcome</i>
<i>in his Octagon debut,</i>

217
00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:55.770
<i>Mark Kerr!</i>

218
00:09:08.249 --> 00:09:09.250
Hi.

219
00:09:12.521 --> 00:09:13.954
Probably looking at my eyes.

220
00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:17.224
-How did that happen?
-(CHUCKLING)

221
00:09:18.426 --> 00:09:19.493
Well, have you ever heard of

222
00:09:19.593 --> 00:09:21.295
