and the goriest sport

240
00:10:01.068 --> 00:10:02.770
-you've ever seen.
-Yeah, I can't do that.

241
00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:04.472
It... it bothers me.

242
00:10:04.573 --> 00:10:06.841
And it should bother
a lot of people.

243
00:10:06.941 --> 00:10:08.776
Do you hate each other
when you fight?

244
00:10:09.443 --> 00:10:10.444
Absolutely not.

245
00:10:10.545 --> 00:10:12.514
PEGGY: Oh.
MARK: Absolutely not. No.

246
00:10:12.613 --> 00:10:13.914
