278
00:11:34.596 --> 00:11:36.163
I'm gonna switch
over to A to Z.

279
00:11:36.263 --> 00:11:38.165
They handle
my insurance much better.

280
00:11:38.265 --> 00:11:39.133
Let's do that. Yeah.

281
00:11:39.233 --> 00:11:40.834
Okay. Sure. Yeah.
That's no problem.

282
00:11:40.935 --> 00:11:42.036
I can switch
the insurance over.

283
00:11:42.136 --> 00:11:43.572
